# Leave unset for local/preview builds: pages then have noindex and no canonical URL.
# For the real published site, set its exact HTTPS origin before npm run build.
# Confirmed production origin; uncomment only for production builds.
# SITE_URL=https://sajinmatchum-tools.pages.dev
# Optional ownership verification values supplied by the site owner's accounts:
# GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=
# NAVER_SITE_VERIFICATION=
